    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "Need pollution coverage separate from auto liability? ",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "Yes. Auto covers accident spills. Equipment failures, valve leaks, loading contamination? That&#8217;s separate pollution coverage. Non-negotiable. "
    }
   },
   {
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "Had a loss last year—am I insurable? ",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "Probably. Costs more, limits options. We work carriers who underwrite individually vs. auto-decline. Show what you&#8217;ve fixed and we&#8217;ll find a market."
    }
   },
